@startuml Redis集群哈希槽分布
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

title Redis集群哈希槽分布

' 定义哈希槽范围
scale 1.0
skinparam ranksep 60

' 创建哈希槽范围图
rectangle "Redis集群哈希槽分布 (总共16384个槽)" {
  rectangle "主节点A\n(192.168.1.1:7000)" as MasterA #LightBlue {
    rectangle "哈希槽 0-5460\n(5461个槽)" as SlotsA #LightCyan
  }
  
  rectangle "主节点B\n(192.168.1.2:7001)" as MasterB #LightBlue {
    rectangle "哈希槽 5461-10922\n(5462个槽)" as SlotsB #LightCyan
  }
  
  rectangle "主节点C\n(192.168.1.3:7002)" as MasterC #LightBlue {
    rectangle "哈希槽 10923-16383\n(5461个槽)" as SlotsC #LightCyan
  }
}

' 添加键哈希示例
note bottom of SlotsA
  **键哈希示例**
  - key:user:1000 → CRC16=1234 → 槽1234 → 节点A
  - key:product:2000 → CRC16=4567 → 槽4567 → 节点A
end note

note bottom of SlotsB
  **键哈希示例**
  - key:order:3000 → CRC16=7890 → 槽7890 → 节点B
  - key:cart:4000 → CRC16=9876 → 槽9876 → 节点B
end note

note bottom of SlotsC
  **键哈希示例**
  - key:session:5000 → CRC16=12345 → 槽12345 → 节点C
  - key:cache:6000 → CRC16=15432 → 槽15432 → 节点C
end note

' 添加哈希槽计算说明
note right
  **哈希槽计算**
  1. 计算键的CRC16校验和
  2. 对16384取模得到槽位
  3. 根据槽位确定负责的节点
  
  **哈希标签**
  - 只计算{}内的内容的哈希值
  - 例如: user:{1000}:profile 和 user:{1000}:settings
    会被分配到同一个哈希槽
  - 用于确保相关键存储在同一节点，支持多键操作
end note

' 添加从节点分布
rectangle "从节点分布" {
  rectangle "从节点A1\n(192.168.1.2:7004)" as SlaveA1 #LightGreen {
    rectangle "哈希槽 0-5460 的副本" as SlotsAReplica #LightYellow
  }
  
  rectangle "从节点B1\n(192.168.1.3:7005)" as SlaveB1 #LightGreen {
    rectangle "哈希槽 5461-10922 的副本" as SlotsBReplica #LightYellow
  }
  
  rectangle "从节点C1\n(192.168.1.1:7003)" as SlaveC1 #LightGreen {
    rectangle "哈希槽 10923-16383 的副本" as SlotsCReplica #LightYellow
  }
}

' 添加复制关系
MasterA -down-> SlaveA1 : 复制数据
MasterB -down-> SlaveB1 : 复制数据
MasterC -down-> SlaveC1 : 复制数据

' 添加扩容示例
rectangle "扩容示例 (添加新主节点D)" {
  rectangle "初始状态" as InitialState {
    rectangle "节点A: 0-5460" as NodeAInitial #LightBlue
    rectangle "节点B: 5461-10922" as NodeBInitial #LightBlue
    rectangle "节点C: 10923-16383" as NodeCInitial #LightBlue
  }
  
  rectangle "重新分片后" as AfterResharding {
    rectangle "节点A: 0-4095" as NodeAAfter #LightBlue
    rectangle "节点B: 4096-8191" as NodeBAfter #LightBlue
    rectangle "节点C: 8192-12287" as NodeCAfter #LightBlue
    rectangle "节点D: 12288-16383" as NodeDAfter #Orange
  }
  
  InitialState -down-> AfterResharding : 重新分片
}

note bottom of AfterResharding
  **扩容过程**
  1. 添加新主节点D到集群
  2. 从现有节点迁移部分槽位到新节点
  3. 迁移过程中数据不中断服务
  4. 客户端根据重定向命令更新路由表
end note

@enduml
